      "파타야 White Widow: balanced hybrid, 현재 데이터 기준 22% THC, 신선도, 효과, availability는 WhatsApp에서 확인.",
    kicker: "대표 품종",
    h1: "파타야 White Widow",
    lead:
      "White Widow는 Labs Cannabis 메뉴의 balanced hybrid 기준점입니다: clear lift, relaxing finish, frosty indoor look, 오늘의 신선한 flower와 비교하기 좋은 첫 선택.",
    note:
      "potency, 신선도, availability는 batch에 따라 달라질 수 있습니다. 방문 전 WhatsApp에서 오늘 사진, 효과, 현재 메뉴 notes를 문의하세요.",
    cta: "WhatsApp에서 White Widow 문의",
    prefill:
      "Hi Labs Cannabis, I am 20+ and in Pattaya. Please send today's White Widow availability, photos, effects, freshness, and pickup/delivery possibilities.",
    facts: [
      { label: "Type", value: "Hybrid" },
      { label: "Verified potency", value: "현재 strain data 기준 22% THC" },
      { label: "Effects", value: "Uplifting, relaxing, balanced" },
    ],
  },
  ja: {
    title: "パタヤ White Widow | 新鮮な hybrid strain | Labs Cannabis",
    description:
      "パタヤの White Widow: balanced hybrid、現在データで 22% THC、鮮度、効果、availability は WhatsApp で確認。",
    kicker: "主力品種",
    h1: "パタヤの White Widow",
    lead:
      "White Widow は Labs Cannabis メニューの balanced hybrid の軸です。clear lift、relaxing finish、frosty indoor look、今日の新鮮な flower と比較しやすい最初の選択です。",
    note:
      "potency、鮮度、availability は batch により変わります。来店前に WhatsApp で今日の写真、効果、現在のメニュー notes を確認してください。",
    cta: "WhatsAppで White Widow を確認",
    prefill:
      "Hi Labs Cannabis, I am 20+ and in Pattaya. Please send today's White Widow availability, photos, effects, freshness, and pickup/delivery possibilities.",
    facts: [
      { label: "Type", value: "Hybrid" },
      { label: "Verified potency", value: "現在の strain data で 22% THC" },
      { label: "Effects", value: "Uplifting, relaxing, balanced" },
    ],
  },
};
const strainCopy = copy[locale] ?? copy.en;
const whatsappHref = `${CONTACT.whatsappWithMsg(strainCopy.prefill)}&source=strain_page`;
const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: ui.nav.home, pathSuffix: "" },
  { name: WHITE_WIDOW.name, pathSuffix: "strains/white-widow" },
];
---

<PageLayout
  locale={locale}
  pathSuffix="strains/white-widow"
  title={strainCopy.title}
  description={strainCopy.description}
  pageType="strain"
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
>
  <section class="px-4 pt-8">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-lg">
      <span class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-dim">{strainCopy.kicker}</span>
      <h1 class="mt-1 text-3xl font-bold">{strainCopy.h1}</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-text-muted">{strainCopy.lead}</p>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-3">
        {strainCopy.facts.map((fact) => (
          <div class="card-surface px-4 py-3">
            <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-text-muted">{fact.label}</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-base font-semibold text-text">{fact.value}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="mt-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-text-muted">{strainCopy.note}</p>
      <a
        href={whatsappHref}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="mt-5 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-emerald px-4 py-3.5 text-base font-bold text-black"
        data-track="contact_whatsapp_click"
        data-track-placement="strain_page"
        data-track-detail="strain:white-widow:whatsapp"
        data-wa-source="strain_page"
        data-whatsapp-ref="white_widow"
      >
        {strainCopy.cta}
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Reels locale={locale} slides={REELS_SLIDES.slice(0, 4)} mini />
  <PriceLadder locale={locale} />
  <ReviewStrip locale={locale} />
  <MapBlock locale={locale} />
  <MedicalCardNote locale={locale} />
  <Footer locale={locale} pathSuffix="strains/white-widow" />
</PageLayout>
